 in one place. Watch your favourite programmes on demand, stream live channels and events, and enjoy content made for the whole wh\u0101nau - anytime, anywhere.\n\nWith the M\u0100ORI+ app, you can:\n- Stream M\u0100ORI+ shows whenever it suits you\n- Save your favourites shows to My List and watch them later\n- Pick up where you left off across your devices\n- Create dedicated profiles for each of your wh\u0101nau members\n- Browse content across easy-to-navigate categories\n- Watch LIVE channels, programmes and special events", "short_description": "M\u0100ORI+ - Nau mai, haere mai to our world of content.\n\nDiscover a world of M\u0101ori stories, culture and entertainment, all in one place. Watch your favourite programmes on demand, stream live channels and events, and enjoy content made for the whole wh\u0101nau - anytime, anywhere."}]}, "developer_name": "Whakaata M\u0101ori", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.maoriplus.co.nz/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.maoriplus.co.nz/terms-of-use", "publisher_name": "Whakaata M\u0101ori", "support_website_url": "https://help.maoriplus.co.nz/", "website_url": "https://www.maoriplus.co.nz/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "mri"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1363792803483515"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "203892723348